WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.540
F5.2 · The Copilot's connection assistant

2
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:09.932
The Copilot is the φ button at the bottom right of every page.

3
00:00:09.982 --> 00:00:12.822
It holds two assistants that set up connections.

4
00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.594
Type /connect and the system's name.

5
00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:21.736
The assistant follows the system's recipe, step by step. No model is called.

6
00:00:22.972 --> 00:00:29.309
First the address and the key. The key goes into its own field, straight to the vault, never into the chat.

7
00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:33.346
Then the test, then the mapping: read the sample before you approve.

8
00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:36.007
An approved mapping runs on its schedule.

9
00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:41.827
Your practice company has its own Halden ERP: connect it and test it.

10
00:00:41.877 --> 00:00:46.955
Approve the mappings in the exam, not here: this company already has its ledger.

11
00:00:48.405 --> 00:00:52.453
Next: F5.3  A Google Sheet that loads itself

